# Output Requirements

Return exactly one JSON object with these three string fields:

- `label`: a specific 3-8 word tactical name summarizing the dominant combined
  pattern.
- `description`: one detailed sentence explaining the integrated observable
  tactical pattern and how its main deviations work together;
- `instruction`: one or two direct coach-style commands that could plausibly
  produce the pattern.

Write the instruction as advice given before play to produce the supplied
tactical pattern. Do not mention z-scores, numerical values, clusters,
statistics, feature identifiers, training data, or the analysis process.

Return English only. Return no markdown or text outside the JSON object.

